🔮 CKD Prediction

After the clinical parameters are submitted, the Flask application prepares the input and sends it to the saved Machine Learning model.

The model processes the supplied features and the application displays the resulting prediction.




📋 Patient Records

The application includes functionality for maintaining patient-related records.

Patient information entered through the application can be stored through the database and accessed through the application's patient record functionality.




📄 PDF Patient Report

The application provides a PDF report feature for patient information and prediction-related results.

PDF generation is implemented using PDFKit.




⚙️ Application Settings

The application also contains a settings page for managing available application options.




🗄️ Database

The application uses SQLite as its local application database.

Database interaction is implemented using Flask-SQLAlchemy.

Database migration management is handled using Flask-Migrate and Alembic.

Database Components
ComponentPurpose	

models.py	Defines database models
Flask-SQLAlchemy	Database interaction
Flask-Migrate	Database migration management
Alembic	Database migration framework
SQLite	Local application database

Database migration files are maintained inside:



migrations/

The migration structure allows database changes to be managed without manually rebuilding the database structure each time.

