⚠️ Disclaimer

This project is developed for educational and demonstration purposes.

The prediction generated by this application should not be considered a medical diagnosis and should not be used as a replacement for consultation with a qualified healthcare professional.

Clinical decisions should be made by qualified healthcare professionals using appropriate medical evaluation and clinical information.

